The '''Pabol Kreeta''' was a [[hyperspace route]] that linked the [[Pabol Sleheyron]] and [[Ootmian Pabol]] hyperlanes in [[Hutt Space]], beginning at the [[Nar Kreeta system]] on the Pabol Sleheyron and ending at the [[Nar Bo Sholla system]] along the Ootmian Pabol.<ref name="Guide" />

